Merged `main` to resolve the conflict with #54874 in `tests/kernels/core/test_uva.py`: the probe tests now use `DEVICES`, and the two tests added in #54874 use the post-init `UVA_AVAILABLE` guard. Updated the docstrings and description to reflect the refined root cause (the allocation stays page-locked; `is_pinned()` reports False) and linked #57224.

@yeighta @sungjungk thank you for validating on SEV-SNP and TDX. A re-run on the new head (f0287f8) would help; the same greedy-parity and #57562 concurrency checks are sufficient.

@njhill the caching feedback is addressed in 985c48e. Could you take another look when you have a chance?

